# `file_descriptor` is external: the `2` in `2>&1` is a descriptor and not the
# word `2`, and only a scanner that sees the following `>` can tell. It is one
# byte wide and the redirect is a sibling of the command, not part of it.
roots 1
mends 0
holds file_descriptor
spans file_descriptor 8 9
holds file_redirect
spans file_redirect 8 12
holds command
spans command 0 7
